WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.607 --> 00:00:05.218
Cold load of the reviewer link on a phone: no layout shift

2
00:00:05.218 --> 00:00:08.557
Price, chart, position and Sell / Buy in one screen

3
00:00:08.557 --> 00:00:14.486
A shorter sheet; the Buy button never leaves the thumb

4
00:00:14.486 --> 00:00:18.384
Order placed. The new buy line arrives where it lives: on the chart

5
00:00:18.384 --> 00:00:29.741
The drag owns the gesture: no crosshair, a tick you can feel, a loupe with the price

6
00:00:29.741 --> 00:00:34.613
Off the line, the chart is the chart: a drag pans time

7
00:00:34.613 --> 00:00:43.702
A trailing stop you can see: it glides up, it never jumps

8
00:00:43.702 --> 00:00:53.982
A trader's toolkit on a phone: indicators, drawings, a chart to share

9
00:00:53.982 --> 00:00:57.601
Offline: the price says Stale, the chart pauses, lines lock

10
00:00:57.601 --> 00:00:59.932
Back online: it all comes back

11
00:00:59.932 --> 00:01:05.994
Home opens on a chart you can trade: HDFC Bank, Paytm, Reliance

12
00:01:05.994 --> 00:01:14.284
The Trade sheet searches every stock, and adds to your watchlist

13
00:01:14.284 --> 00:01:17.187
Paytm is now in My Watchlist

14
00:01:17.187 --> 00:01:20.193
nthstock · paper trading, virtual cash
